  "description": "DSH 外部插件：reasoning 块出生即压缩（CAS 原文归档 + 认知编译器压缩，编造标识符或失败时原文放行）。",
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  }
